ZicoSeq-derived implementation
==============================

R/zicoseq.R is derived from the ZicoSeq implementation distributed in
GUniFrac 1.9 under GPL-3.

Original GUniFrac/ZicoSeq authors credited by the package DESCRIPTION:

* Jun Chen
* Xianyang Zhang
* Lu Yang
* Lujun Zhang

IRS modifications replace internal reference selection with a fixed IRS
reference set, match references by taxon name, preserve original-count IRS
reference totals across feature filtering and winsorization, add strict input
alignment and zero-denominator behavior, and report IRS provenance.

Vandeputte 2017 example data
============================

The vandeputte2017 data object contains genus-level 16S counts, sample group,
and flow-cytometry microbial-load measurements from:

Vandeputte D, Kathagen G, D'hoe K, et al. (2017). Quantitative microbiome
profiling links gut community variation to microbial load. Nature 551,
507-511. https://doi.org/10.1038/nature24460

The processed count and load files were obtained from the CellCount_Nishijima_
2024 data release by Suguru Nishijima:

https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.14243685

